{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18774","headline":"贾客词 · 刘禹锡","name":"贾客词","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"贾客无定游，所游唯利幷。\n眩俗杂良苦，乘时取重轻。\n心计析秋毫，摇钩侔悬衡。\n锥刀既无弃，转化日已盈。\n邀福祷波神，施财游化城。\n妻约雕金钏，女垂贯珠缨。\n高赀比封君，奇货通幸卿。\n趋时鸷鸟思，藏镪盘龙形。\n大艑浮通川，高楼次旗亭。\n行止皆有乐，关梁自无征。\n农夫何爲者，辛苦事寒耕。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18774.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18774","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}